      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "营救荒原幸存者并以建筑摆位抵挡失控AI敌潮",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Rescue survivors from the wastes. Defend your people against waves of attacks from the rogue AI that ruined the old world. Procedural levels and random build order make every run unique. Carve your way through the post-post-apocalyptic sprawl to find valuable resources and rescue settlers. Every building you construct and how you position it affects your settlement's chance of survival.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3580340/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "程序化关卡与随机建造顺序重排每次重建路线",
      "dimension": "玩法",
